==English==
[[Image:TE-Nervous system diagram.svg|thumb|upright|An overview of the human nervous system.]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[nervous]] [[system]]}}

# {{neuroanatomy}} An [[organ]] system that [[coordinate]]s the activities of muscles, [[monitor]]s organs, [[construct]]s and [[process]]es data received from the senses{{,}} and [[initiate]]s actions.

====Synonyms====
* [[systema nervosum]]

====Meronyms====
* [[brain]]
* [[brainstem]]
* [[ganglion]]
* [[nerve]]
* [[spinal cord]]

====Derived terms====
* [[autonomic nervous system]]
* [[central nervous system]]
* [[peripheral nervous system]]

